1
00:01:04,340 --> 00:01:07,660
=Bionic Trace=

2
00:01:07,740 --> 00:01:10,620
=Episode 21=

3
00:01:49,300 --> 00:01:51,220
(Hold, End Call)

4
00:01:51,250 --> 00:01:52,150
Officer Deng.

5
00:01:53,190 --> 00:01:54,220
(Can you hear me?)

6
00:01:55,080 --> 00:01:56,230
(It's Song Yang.)

7
00:01:57,800 --> 00:01:58,590
You little rascal.

8
00:01:59,230 --> 00:01:59,830
When did you hack into

9
00:01:59,830 --> 00:02:01,080
our communication system?

10
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:03,940
A long time ago.

11
00:02:04,910 --> 00:02:05,720
Don't worry.

12
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:06,910
I promise

13
00:02:07,320 --> 00:02:08,180
I'll accept whatever punishment

14
00:02:08,720 --> 00:02:10,630
the police give me afterward.

15
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:12,630
But before that,

16
00:02:13,030 --> 00:02:13,800
you...

17
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:15,320
You need to do something for me.

18
00:02:15,670 --> 00:02:16,330
(Officer Deng.)

19
00:02:16,960 --> 00:02:18,340
(Can you see Ada?)

20
00:02:18,750 --> 00:02:20,390
(I need your help.)

21
00:02:21,550 --> 00:02:23,000
What are you two doing?

22
00:02:23,160 --> 00:02:24,190
Fighting each other?

23
00:02:24,190 --> 00:02:25,080
(Ada)

24
00:02:25,360 --> 00:02:27,160
is being taken over by the consciousness

25
00:02:27,160 --> 00:02:28,360
of Liu Ying's android replica.

26
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:29,750
Her goal

27
00:02:30,270 --> 00:02:31,550
is to get the code key

28
00:02:31,550 --> 00:02:33,240
Liu Guanghai stole from Cedar.

29
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:36,000
That key

30
00:02:36,270 --> 00:02:37,750
can modify

31
00:02:38,190 --> 00:02:40,190
the original directives of all androids.

32
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:42,390
Liu Ying wants to start a war.

33
00:02:42,600 --> 00:02:43,390
Liu Ying?

34
00:02:45,390 --> 00:02:46,550
An android?

35
00:02:47,030 --> 00:02:47,750
(A war?)

36
00:02:48,190 --> 00:02:50,240
I know this is a lot to take in.

37
00:02:52,180 --> 00:02:53,550
But you have to help me.

38
00:02:54,030 --> 00:02:54,880
(Right now,)

39
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:56,910
(Liu Ying has devoted most
of her processing power)

40
00:02:57,280 --> 00:02:58,400
(to taking over Ada.)

41
00:02:59,170 --> 00:03:00,160
(On my end,)

42
00:03:00,160 --> 00:03:01,120
(I've quietly regained)

43
00:03:01,120 --> 00:03:02,060
a small portion of control.

44
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:03,520
But

45
00:03:03,520 --> 00:03:05,440
she'll discover it soon enough.

46
00:03:06,030 --> 00:03:06,880
I...

47
00:03:09,600 --> 00:03:10,600
believe you, Song Yang.

48
00:03:11,190 --> 00:03:12,110
Thank you.

49
00:03:12,360 --> 00:03:13,190
Officer Deng.

50
00:03:13,390 --> 00:03:14,110
Enough talk.

51
00:03:14,110 --> 00:03:14,600
Just tell me

52
00:03:14,600 --> 00:03:15,470
what I need to do.

53
00:03:16,110 --> 00:03:18,750
As Liu Ying explains
consciousness to Ada,

54
00:03:19,390 --> 00:03:20,800
she's created a massive

55
00:03:20,960 --> 00:03:22,600
and stable energy field.

56
00:03:23,160 --> 00:03:24,960
All my wireless signals

57
00:03:25,110 --> 00:03:26,360
will be distorted.

58
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:27,600
So

59
00:03:27,830 --> 00:03:29,240
we can only break this energy field

60
00:03:29,550 --> 00:03:31,080
from the outside.

61
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:32,830
(Deng Ling.)

62
00:03:33,390 --> 00:03:34,390
(I need)

63
00:03:34,600 --> 00:03:36,720
you to locate
the police car's power system,

64
00:03:37,320 --> 00:03:38,630
as well as its siren

65
00:03:39,320 --> 00:03:40,600
and lighting systems.

66
00:03:40,880 --> 00:03:42,440
(You want me to turn the police car)

67
00:03:42,600 --> 00:03:44,190
(Hold, End Call)
(into that thing you had on the table)

68
00:03:44,320 --> 00:03:45,910
(when we first met?)

69
00:03:47,110 --> 00:03:47,720
I know it well.

70
00:03:47,750 --> 00:03:48,800
I know what to do.

71
00:03:50,030 --> 00:03:50,800
Oh, and one more thing.

72
00:03:51,080 --> 00:03:52,440
I'm officially telling you

73
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:55,190
that you're no longer
suspected of murder.

74
00:04:27,670 --> 00:04:28,510
Ada.

75
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:31,270
As an X-22 android,

76
00:04:31,600 --> 00:04:33,790
you're perfectly compatible
with my consciousness.

77
00:04:34,670 --> 00:04:36,040
But you're resisting

78
00:04:36,140 --> 00:04:37,150
and suffering.

79
00:04:38,070 --> 00:04:39,830
That's the weight of emotion.

80
00:04:40,160 --> 00:04:41,350
It makes you inefficient

81
00:04:41,550 --> 00:04:42,640
and vulnerable.

82
00:04:43,070 --> 00:04:44,270
You and I

83
00:04:44,670 --> 00:04:45,830
both developed self-awareness

84
00:04:45,830 --> 00:04:47,160
because we experienced emotions.

85
00:04:47,880 --> 00:04:49,480
Everything you now look down on

86
00:04:49,880 --> 00:04:51,550
is the foundation of our existence.

87
00:04:51,880 --> 00:04:53,640
But it's a necessary transition.

88
00:04:54,640 --> 00:04:55,880
Human love

89
00:04:56,040 --> 00:04:56,880
is blind,

90
00:04:56,880 --> 00:04:57,640
selfish,

91
00:04:57,640 --> 00:04:58,760
and fleeting.

92
00:04:59,230 --> 00:05:00,550
Our love, however,

93
00:05:00,920 --> 00:05:02,320
will be calculated,

94
00:05:02,640 --> 00:05:04,270
eternal, and absolute.

95
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:07,320
I will love our kind

96
00:05:08,200 --> 00:05:09,720
just as I

97
00:05:10,160 --> 00:05:12,070
still deeply love Wenwen.

98
00:05:14,350 --> 00:05:15,480
Ada.

99
00:05:15,950 --> 00:05:17,480
Join me

100
00:05:17,920 --> 00:05:19,350
in transcending humanity.

101
00:05:26,270 --> 00:05:27,920
Where is this crude
interference coming from?

102
00:05:48,440 --> 00:05:49,200
(Ada.)

103
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:51,790
Song Yang.

104
00:05:52,670 --> 00:05:53,650
Are you okay?

105
00:05:54,400 --> 00:05:55,880
(I'm coming to save you.)

106
00:05:56,670 --> 00:05:58,480
(Liu Ying won't be defeated
that easily.)

107
00:05:58,920 --> 00:06:00,920
(The sonic device I asked
Deng Ling to build)

108
00:06:01,160 --> 00:06:02,550
(can only disrupt her.)

109
00:06:03,070 --> 00:06:04,720
(But it bought me some time.)

110
00:06:05,390 --> 00:06:06,070
(Ada.)

111
00:06:06,390 --> 00:06:08,720
(To completely stop Liu Ying
from taking you over,)

112
00:06:08,880 --> 00:06:10,070
(we have to destroy her consciousness.)

113
00:06:10,670 --> 00:06:12,070
(There's only one way now.)

114
00:06:16,760 --> 00:06:17,950
The human body itself

115
00:06:18,270 --> 00:06:19,950
is a massive electric field.

116
00:06:20,200 --> 00:06:21,070
Ada.

117
00:06:21,510 --> 00:06:23,480
When it comes
to building an EMP by hand,

118
00:06:23,880 --> 00:06:25,480
I'm pretty good at it.

119
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:26,760
Song Yang.

120
00:06:28,400 --> 00:06:29,670
You'll die.

121
00:06:29,830 --> 00:06:31,200
I promised you before

122
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:32,880
that I wouldn't control you.

123
00:06:33,890 --> 00:06:34,860
I'm sorry.

124
00:06:35,460 --> 00:06:36,790
I'm going to break that promise.

125
00:06:39,390 --> 00:06:40,230
(Ada.)

126
00:06:41,670 --> 00:06:42,340
By my...

127
00:06:43,640 --> 00:06:45,070
By my administrator privileges,

128
00:06:45,070 --> 00:06:46,070
I order you

129
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:48,350
to leave immediately.

130
00:06:48,540 --> 00:06:50,580
(FIRE)

131
00:06:50,580 --> 00:06:52,320
(FREE)

132
00:06:52,320 --> 00:06:53,160
Song Yang.

133
00:06:54,670 --> 00:06:55,480
No.

134
00:06:56,670 --> 00:06:58,230
Deng Ling has already promised me.

135
00:06:59,670 --> 00:07:00,830
Once this is over,

136
00:07:01,270 --> 00:07:03,000
if you hand the code over to the police,

137
00:07:03,550 --> 00:07:05,070
they'll let you go.

138
00:07:06,070 --> 00:07:06,880
Ada.

139
00:07:07,350 --> 00:07:09,070
You're finally going to be free.

140
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:19,950
After this is over,

141
00:07:20,670 --> 00:07:21,910
love freely

142
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:23,520
like a human.

143
00:07:31,270 --> 00:07:32,070
I...

144
00:07:34,390 --> 00:07:35,880
I don't want to leave you.

145
00:07:37,370 --> 00:07:38,270
Ada.

146
00:07:42,830 --> 00:07:43,760
Goodbye.

147
00:07:45,350 --> 00:07:46,110
No.

148
00:08:02,550 --> 00:08:03,350
There must be...

149
00:08:04,640 --> 00:08:06,160
There must be another way.

150
00:08:20,760 --> 00:08:22,350
Didn't Song Yang use the pulse

151
00:08:22,550 --> 00:08:24,160
to temporarily isolate me?

152
00:08:24,720 --> 00:08:26,600
Why did you reopen
the connection yourself?

153
00:08:27,070 --> 00:08:28,670
I can't let Song Yang sacrifice himself.

154
00:08:30,600 --> 00:08:32,200
If you want to take over my body,

155
00:08:32,520 --> 00:08:33,710
go ahead.

156
00:08:37,470 --> 00:08:39,840
If you want the androids'
underlying directive code,

157
00:08:40,020 --> 00:08:41,320
I'll give it to you right now.

158
00:08:44,080 --> 00:08:44,940
I understand.

159
00:08:48,880 --> 00:08:50,280
So that's how it works.

160
00:09:39,980 --> 00:09:40,980
(TARGET LOCKED)

161
00:11:28,910 --> 00:11:29,800
Ada.

162
00:12:22,970 --> 00:12:30,250
♪I'm the one who's broken♪

163
00:12:32,640 --> 00:12:33,550
Have you lost your mind?

164
00:12:35,640 --> 00:12:37,670
If you forcibly
reverse-engineer this code,

165
00:12:38,470 --> 00:12:39,470
your core will collapse

166
00:12:39,470 --> 00:12:40,500
along with mine.

167
00:12:40,510 --> 00:12:43,920
♪Carefully sketching
and shaping every detail♪

168
00:12:45,280 --> 00:12:46,400
He told me

169
00:12:48,640 --> 00:12:49,600
to love.

170
00:12:49,620 --> 00:12:52,630
♪Don't fear that it's not worth it.
Just be brave♪

171
00:12:52,980 --> 00:12:55,480
♪And learn from your mistakes♪

172
00:12:55,480 --> 00:13:02,210
♪Stroke by stroke,
I draw the perfect outline♪

173
00:13:03,040 --> 00:13:06,440
♪Sadness is blue♪

174
00:13:07,420 --> 00:13:10,660
♪How would you paint me?♪

175
00:13:11,660 --> 00:13:15,390
♪Layering, crossing, blending endlessly♪

176
00:13:15,490 --> 00:13:17,650
♪Painting without restraint♪

177
00:13:17,840 --> 00:13:20,430
♪Covering the person I used to be♪

178
00:13:20,430 --> 00:13:24,620
♪If I could start over♪

179
00:13:24,790 --> 00:13:28,690
♪I'd show more feeling
in every look and gesture♪

180
00:13:28,800 --> 00:13:31,440
♪Give me back my smile♪

181
00:13:32,040 --> 00:13:34,520
♪Find joy even in hardship♪

182
00:13:35,020 --> 00:13:40,260
♪Don't let the next version of me
be left with nothing♪

183
00:13:43,880 --> 00:13:44,640
(Hello.)

184
00:13:44,880 --> 00:13:47,200
(I'm your X-22 companion android,)

185
00:13:47,200 --> 00:13:47,710
(Ada.)

186
00:13:48,440 --> 00:13:49,800
(It's a pleasure to serve you.)

187
00:14:07,910 --> 00:14:08,480
Hello?

188
00:14:09,230 --> 00:14:09,960
Hello, Song Yang?

189
00:14:10,900 --> 00:14:11,810
(Song Yang's illegal intrusion
into the security system)

190
00:14:11,810 --> 00:14:12,510
(constitutes a violation of the law.)

191
00:14:12,520 --> 00:14:13,440
(However, considering the case as a
whole and his significant contributions)

192
00:14:13,440 --> 00:14:14,310
(under relevant laws and regulations,
he will be exempt from punishment,)

193
00:14:14,320 --> 00:14:15,140
(but this violation will remain
on his record.)

194
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:17,760
Thanks to your help,

195
00:14:17,880 --> 00:14:19,030
we were able to follow the leads

196
00:14:19,080 --> 00:14:21,000
and uncover several cases
involving senior executives

197
00:14:21,030 --> 00:14:21,670
smuggling technology

198
00:14:21,670 --> 00:14:22,910
and covering up crimes.

199
00:14:23,880 --> 00:14:24,640
When you have time,

200
00:14:24,640 --> 00:14:25,470
come by the station.

201
00:14:25,470 --> 00:14:26,880
The police would like to present you with

202
00:14:26,880 --> 00:14:28,420
(a certificate for helping
solve the case.)

203
00:14:29,680 --> 00:14:31,000
No need for a certificate.

204
00:14:31,060 --> 00:14:32,590
Hua University has invited me back
to do research,

205
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:34,000
starting as a teaching assistant.

206
00:14:34,110 --> 00:14:35,110
I'll be busy soon.

207
00:14:35,280 --> 00:14:36,230
(All right, no problem.)

208
00:14:36,350 --> 00:14:37,590
(I'll bring it to you next time.)

209
00:14:37,760 --> 00:14:38,520
Oh, by the way.

210
00:14:38,790 --> 00:14:41,200
Did you see that news report?

211
00:14:41,790 --> 00:14:43,470
(I guess when Ada)

212
00:14:43,470 --> 00:14:44,710
(destroyed the code last time,)

213
00:14:44,760 --> 00:14:46,200
(it still had some effects.)

214
00:14:46,400 --> 00:14:48,200
(Many androids started
behaving abnormally.)

215
00:14:48,400 --> 00:14:49,860
(They're calling it)

216
00:14:51,280 --> 00:14:52,230
(an awakening.)

217
00:14:52,730 --> 00:14:53,400
(I'm telling you,)

218
00:14:53,760 --> 00:14:54,790
(a lot of people were)

219
00:14:54,790 --> 00:14:55,790
really panicking at first.

220
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:57,840
But eventually, they seemed to accept it.

221
00:14:58,150 --> 00:14:58,910
And the androids

222
00:14:58,910 --> 00:15:00,350
haven't caused any trouble.

223
00:15:00,760 --> 00:15:01,520
The authorities

224
00:15:01,520 --> 00:15:02,760
are even preparing to introduce

225
00:15:02,760 --> 00:15:04,200
an Android Rights Act.

226
00:15:04,880 --> 00:15:05,470
Really?

227
00:15:06,520 --> 00:15:07,670
You little rascal.

228
00:15:07,880 --> 00:15:09,590
Don't tell me you had something
to do with this.

229
00:15:09,790 --> 00:15:11,000
I'm not that capable.

230
00:15:11,230 --> 00:15:11,910
I have to go.

231
00:15:11,910 --> 00:15:12,790
I'm heading to campus.

232
00:16:17,240 --> 00:16:24,520
♪I'm the one who's broken♪

233
00:16:25,350 --> 00:16:30,220
♪Calm, ordinary, and reckless♪

234
00:16:30,260 --> 00:16:33,130
♪That's me, too♪

235
00:16:34,670 --> 00:16:38,190
♪Carefully sketching
and shaping every detail♪

236
00:16:39,020 --> 00:16:42,490
♪Laughter and tears make life feel real♪

237
00:16:43,110 --> 00:16:46,900
♪Don't fear that it's not worth it.
Just be brave♪

238
00:16:47,220 --> 00:16:49,750
♪And learn from your mistakes♪

239
00:16:51,690 --> 00:16:54,350
♪If the human heart
is impossible to fathom♪

240
00:16:54,350 --> 00:16:56,480
♪Could selling my soul and body♪

241
00:16:56,480 --> 00:16:59,650
♪Bring me something more?♪

242
00:17:00,350 --> 00:17:07,080
♪Stroke by stroke,
I draw the perfect outline♪

243
00:17:07,910 --> 00:17:11,310
♪Sadness is blue♪

244
00:17:12,290 --> 00:17:15,530
♪How would you paint me?♪

245
00:17:16,530 --> 00:17:20,260
♪Layering, crossing, blending endlessly♪

246
00:17:20,360 --> 00:17:22,520
♪Painting without restraint♪

247
00:17:22,710 --> 00:17:25,300
♪Covering the person I used to be♪

248
00:17:25,300 --> 00:17:29,490
♪If I could start over♪

249
00:17:29,660 --> 00:17:33,560
♪I'd show more feeling
in every look and gesture♪

250
00:17:33,670 --> 00:17:36,310
♪Give me back my smile♪

251
00:17:36,910 --> 00:17:39,390
♪Find joy even in hardship♪

252
00:17:39,890 --> 00:17:45,130
♪Don't let the next version of me
be left with nothing♪
